":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["一元函数微分学应用","二阶导数判凹凸性","定积分不等式","定积分应用","平面图形质心"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-247/solution_01.png","original_sha256":"6d4f75d7c92c3dd5584a6bbaae40b63b25d30662456c466e2a2d8d91bc9441a4","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":192099,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:055ae0274638ea127f4a2b2f","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/770bfdd29098c09d53008d6ce0f6247c4682313b729cb7dcb15db8e60cfbed16.json","sha256":"ced4f2545ebd52cc8bd528919e33c3a281dd23224b4049f8563843ef5ccbbf6e"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-247/solution_01.png","sha256":"6d4f75d7c92c3dd5584a6bbaae40b63b25d30662456c466e2a2d8d91bc9441a4"}],"text":""},"source:29d8f0fc6858fdb2c1711e41":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["单正态总体均值区间"],"metadata":{},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:29d8f0fc6858fdb2c1711e41","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-765_单正态总体均值区间.md","sha256":"055ec26dabeb0a8073eaaf5f9164a67bbe55df0ff9ba1d65143d81a0b36f7bae"}],"text":"# 单正态总体均值区间\n\n本页是由五份讲义来源提炼的通用知识锚点，不含本人作答证据；关联题只表示知识点归属，不推断错因、掌握度或复习状态。\n\n## 范围\n\nσ²已知用正态枢轴，未知用t与S；分别保留单侧或双侧的尾部配置。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\nn与n-1、S与σ不可混；正态总体前提和非正态大样本近似须区别。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| FH-B | 2027考研数学--概率统计就这点事-基础篇--方浩.pdf | 199–203 | 194–198 | 置信区间 |\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 76 | 75 | 置信区间 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 参数估计（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n- 抽样分布（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n- prerequisite → PR11.09：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`PR11.03`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:378ae99eb3ccaf7e751df99d":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["夹逼准则","数项级数敛散性判别","无穷级数","极限比较判别法","正项级数敛散性判别","正项级数比较判别法","等价无穷小","级数收敛必要条件"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-494/question_01.png","original_sha256":"279447d28bdb5a9b43448dbd62edc0db6e58bc0e96362294fda8fa3d95d412dc","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":326308,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:378ae99eb3ccaf7e751df99d","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/7c1a15c735669aac885b2719c2b9fa97e28320e7d4d3448b25f24c81ae87f50c.json","sha256":"ab230e6ced83f534c2396baa381cfdc85c6a5b1d79766dd954fd2dc249192300"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-494/question_01.png","sha256":"279447d28bdb5a9b43448dbd62edc0db6e58bc0e96362294fda8fa3d95d412dc"}],"text":""},"source:5bfe55f12e2bb2934278d945":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["一元函数积分学的计算","不定积分","分段函数积分","分段函数连续可导","分部积分","原函数","极限与连续"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-290/solution_01.png","original_sha256":"3350609fd5e0ca3f7a0395dd7419494e22af317c8285118477f43e3ef4712249","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":108712,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:5bfe55f12e2bb2934278d945","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/99f539eac6279c4c0db7711fa7ce44f813cd1713090041dc136d7a102bd71aec.json","sha256":"69c8be8e28cc029234eddbebe4df4fd3112854cd3669281ef1c22fee222d6741"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-